    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute puddings of three colors collect hearts on the cake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have to do is decide on the order and timing to call the puddings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look at the stage made of square cakes from various angles and guide the pudding to the heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 24 stages in total. A colorful and sweet 3D puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Please feel free to use live commentary and distribution. If possible, please paste the URL of this page in the video description field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*This game is an expanded version of the game &quot;nice pudding world&quot; that was previously published on a free game posting site. Stages from levels 1 to 8 are the same as the free game version. Please keep this in mind.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute puddings of three colors collect hearts on the cake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have to do is decide on the order and timing to call the puddings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look at the stage made of square cakes from various angles and guide the pudding to the heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 24 stages in total. A colorful and sweet 3D puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Please feel free to use live commentary and distribution. If possible, please paste the URL of this page in the video description field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*This game is an expanded version of the game &quot;nice pudding world&quot; that was previously published on a free game posting site. Stages from levels 1 to 8 are the same as the free game version. Please keep this in mind.</p>",
